# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Prettier writes and verifies LF, so a CRLF checkout makes `npm run format:check`
# fail on the whole tree before it can report a real formatting problem. Without
# this, `core.autocrlf=true` — the default from Git for Windows' installer —
# produces exactly that checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
